doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22099960
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nabahel/rivest-mc"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "rivest-mc: simulation and calibration tools for the Rivest post-calving caribou abundance estimator"
abstract: >-
  An independent Python implementation of the Rivest two-phase post-calving
  abundance estimator, validated against the CRAN caribou package, together with
  Monte Carlo machinery for measuring its bias, RMSE and interval coverage under
  controlled departures from the random-mixing assumption, and a calibration of
  the randomness score test for realistic survey sizes.
